tasks.prompt:
Lumen's help center. At `/`: a hero with a search field that filters the article list as the user types, four category cards (Basics, Analytics, Issues, Account) with article counts, and a list of popular articles. At `/articles/getting-started`: the article page with a breadcrumb back to the help center, title and reading time, a few sections of body text with headings, an 'On this page' table of contents beside the text on desktop (hidden on phones), and 'Was this helpful?' yes/no buttons. Both routes share a header with the Lumen name and a 'Contact support' button.

